cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the article below."
type: software
title: ONCOcurve
abstract: >-
  Browser-based survival analysis for oncological cohorts: Kaplan-Meier
  curves, log-rank tests and Cox regression from cancer registry exports
  (oBDS), OncoBox files or simple tables. All data processing runs locally
  in the browser.
